<p>
  CIE's two True-RMS clamp multimeters, the <a href={u('/products/clamp-meters/dcm-2250-tr/')}>DCM 2250 TR</a> and the <a href={u('/products/clamp-meters/dcm-5410-tr/')}>DCM 5410 TR</a>, look almost identical: same 40 mm jaw, same 6000-count display, same CAT III 600 V rating, same 2 × AAA power. The difference that matters is one line in the specification: whether the clamp can read <strong>DC current</strong>. This guide helps you decide which one your work actually needs.
</p>

